   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/roopikarisam.bsky.social/post/3n2tx6emyhs2l",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://futurism.com/future-society/ai-errors-productivity-verification-burden-useful?fbclid=IwdGRjcAVu2rhleHRuA2FlbQIxMQBwZG9mAWZkaWQWUSpHe79rPMyanOb2Mxt6YINMGv7RFHNydGMGYXBwX2lkCjY2Mjg1NjgzNzkAAR9JsmMY-2XR0xORWl1EKT2EcpLbq6Gp5cLDw3gO-uaYi4UQYZ5tg0EimNZjGA_aem_X8-ca3ARLTOSWoiM2DwRBw",
   "query": "Claude AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "It is at least *possible* that the bubble just popped, leaving Anthropic with $81.3 billion and OpenAI with nothing. \n\nThis would not be good, if true. But it *would* be funny.",
   "handle": "davekarpf.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Dave Karpf",
   "likes": 514,
   "reposts": 84,
   "replies": 19,
   "created_at": "2026-11-20T20:39:38.676Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/davekarpf.bsky.social/post/3n2rgz4y2ns2k",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "When we say \"AI\" do we mean the range of LLM-applications that are actually useful, and will endure after the bubble pops? Or do we mean the massive, overwhelming, and nakedly politically motivated, cash-grabbing project of intellectual enclosure and deskilling hype machine pumping that bubble up?",
   "handle": "zunguzungu.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Aaron Bady",
   "likes": 495,
   "reposts": 82,
   "replies": 26,
   "created_at": "2026-11-21T14:44:32.770Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zunguzungu.bsky.social/post/3n2tdn3jwyk23",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "Here’s my full CNBC hit covering Anthropic, NVIDIA, Oracle, circular financing, and how the worst is yet to come for AI. \nwww.cnbc.com/video/2026/1...",
   "handle": "edzitron.com",
   "display_name": "Ed Zitron",
   "likes": 470,
   "reposts": 76,
   "replies": 27,
   "created_at": "2026-11-20T22:51:17.908Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/edzitron.com/post/3n2roekbbl227",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Did the AI bubble just pop? Or at least start deflating?\n\nNvidia scandal with Jensen Huang and smuggling to China, company acting like they fear scrutiny, big stock decline.\n\nAnthropic stock decline in public trading.\n\nNASDAQ in correction.\n\nTrump corruption looks on its way out, regulations coming.",
   "handle": "nicholasgrossman.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Nicholas Grossman",
   "likes": 424,
   "reposts": 83,
   "replies": 32,
   "created_at": "2026-11-21T13:04:24.423Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/nicholasgrossman.bsky.social/post/3n2t5zzjpnk2d",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Anthropic owes the authors of *482,460* works - this includes me - in a settlement that is both historic and paltry. Are the newly minted Anthropic millionaires - just riffing here - safe near, for example, me?",
   "handle": "robdelaney.bsky.social",
